---
const faqs = [
  {
    q: "How much does it cost?",
    a: "Launch is €12,500/month, Scale is €19,500/month, Embed is €17.5–25.5k/month on top of a base tier. Start with the Sprint at €6,250 — full credit toward month 1 if you sign within 14 days.",
  },
  {
    q: "What's a build point?",
    a: "A unit of work a senior engineer + AI agents can ship in roughly half a day. A new onboarding screen is ~1 point. A subscription paywall with App Store integration is 2–3. A multi-tenant permission system is 6–8. Launch includes 18/month, Scale includes 36.",
  },
  {
    q: "Who actually does the work?",
    a: "Tom or Callum reviews every meaningful product decision and every meaningful piece of code. Senior engineers do the build. AI agents handle boilerplate, tests, and infrastructure underneath. We don't grow by rotating juniors onto your project.",
  },
  {
    q: "Why not hire a CTO instead?",
    a: "A first CTO will spend six months hiring, not building. Cost: £200k+ all-in, plus equity, plus six months to find the right one. StaaS gets you the same calibre of judgement plus working software in week one — no equity, no recruitment cost, no wait.",
  },
  {
    q: "How fast will we see working software?",
    a: "Week one. The Sprint produces working software in two weeks. Subscription sprints ship every two weeks after that. We don't do quarter-long discoveries.",
  },
  {
    q: "Can we pause?",
    a: "Yes. Launch tier pauses up to 60 days. Banked days convert to maintenance — security patches, App Store submissions, bug fixes — while you decide what's next.",
  },
  {
    q: "Do you take equity?",
    a: "No. Fixed monthly fee. You keep all of the upside.",
  },
  {
    q: "What about IP ownership?",
    a: "Everything we build is yours. Code, designs, assets, App Store accounts — all transferred at handover. No lock-in.",
  },
  {
    q: "Can you work with our existing codebase?",
    a: "Yes. We regularly pick up projects mid-stream, audit existing code, fix security debt, and improve what's already there.",
  },
  {
    q: "What if we hate the work?",
    a: "Full refund within the first three days. After that, the 3-month minimum applies — but if a build is going the wrong way we'll re-plan mid-cycle rather than power through.",
  },
];
---

<section class="bg-cream py-24 md:py-[120px]">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px] px-6">

    <p class="font-mono text-xs text-coral mb-10 tracking-wider">// faq</p>

    <h2 class="font-serif text-5xl md:text-6xl text-navy leading-tight tracking-tight max-w-lg mb-16">
      You're probably wondering...
    </h2>

    <div class="flex flex-col" style="border-top: 1px solid #d8d0a8;">
      {faqs.map((faq) => (
        <details class="group border-b" style="border-color: #d8d0a8;">
          <summary class="flex items-center justify-between cursor-pointer list-none py-6 gap-4">
            <span class="font-sans font-medium text-base text-navy pr-4">{faq.q}</span>
            <span class="faq-plus shrink-0 w-6 h-6 rounded-full border border-navy-muted flex items-center justify-center text-navy transition-transform duration-200">
              <svg width="10" height="10" viewBox="0 0 10 10" fill="none">
                <path d="M5 1v8M1 5h8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
              </svg>
            </span>
          </summary>
          <p class="pb-6 text-sm text-navy-muted leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">{faq.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
